      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requirements :\n1. Upload short videos : Vertical Only\n2. Infinity User Scroll\n3. Auto play video instantly\n4. Feed is personalized using ML\n5. Continous engagment ranking rating system\n\n\nFunctional Requirement :\n1. Upload shorts (Validation : < 90s)\n2. Process and Transcode the video\n3. Moderata Content\n4. Generate Personalized Feed\n5. Instant Video Streaming\n6. Capture engagement : like comment watch\n7. Detect trends\n",
